WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.820
Thank you for taking these minutes for yourself.

2
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.320
I'm Liubov.

3
00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:09.000
I was the one who always delivered, until my health stopped me.

4
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.860
What brought me back wasn't pushing harder.

5
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.400
It was silence.

6
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.100
A moment each day that belonged only to me.

7
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.760
That's why I'm building Tysha.

8
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.950
It means “silence” in Ukrainian.

9
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.220
A moment and a place, protected from the noise,

10
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:30.300
that help you turn caring for your mind into a daily habit.

11
00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.750
Your answers help shape it. Thank you.

12
00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.880
If you'd like to be part of what comes next,

13
00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.200
join the Tysha pilot in 2027

14
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.120
and support Tysha in its early days:

15
00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.600
just tick it below.

16
00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:48.100
And whatever you choose, don't forget:

17
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.400
take a moment for yourself today.
